<title>KENYA: Nine killed, 20 injured in Kenya mini-bus crash.</title>
<headline>Nine killed, 20 injured in Kenya mini-bus crash.</headline>
<dateline>NAIROBI 1997-02-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine people were killed and 20 injured when a minibus crashed in western Kenya on Sunday, Kenyan radio reported.</p>
<p>The radio said the driver of the minibus had been arrested.</p>
<p>Five of the injured were admitted to hospital in serious condition after the accident, just outside Kericho town, centre of a tea-growing area.</p>
